### ============================================================
### Security checks — verify the filter chain
### Public endpoints should be 200, protected endpoints 401/403
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Public: Swagger UI (HTML page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

### Public: OpenAPI spec (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### Public: Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Protected: list tasks (should be 401/403 until JWT is added)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?userId=1

### Protected: create task (should be 401/403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should be blocked",
  "dueDate": "2026-02-01"
}